This patch adapts Go 1.27.1 src/encoding/asn1/marshal.go under the retained
Go BSD license. The original source header remains in the patched output.

Recursive field construction yields after 64 levels. Tagged encoders cache
their immutable length and traverse sequence children with an explicit stack.
SET encoders retain the original byte order and yield before nested sets.
The existing BitString composite conversion remains unchanged.

